# Play test of Caravan Town Remade (CIPlay caravan_town_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# market in the inlet (1.6 m), the lift's ladders on its south face, the upper town and the mayor's pillar (21.9 m).
island Caravan Town Remade
expect step 0
expect title The Mayor's Toll

# Into the market: the toll notice, the ledger
at -9 -1
zone market
expect step 1
read Toll notice
expect step 2
read Market ledger
expect step 3

# The winch has no crank yet
at -16.5 8
use winch
expect message no crank
expect step 3

# Down into the bay: the air pocket, the diver's crate by the sunken trailer
at -12.5 -12 h=-1
air airpocket
zone airpocket
expect step 4
open Diver's crate
expect story crank 1
expect step 6

# Up the lift - its three ladders - and out onto the upper town; the bridge wound across, over to the mayor's pillar
climb -12.5 -5.6 h=1.6
climb -15.5 -5.6 h=7.9
climb -12.5 -5.6 h=14.9
walk -14 -1 to -14 2 to -16 5 to -16.5 8 h=21.9
use winch
expect message slides out
wait 4
walk -15.5 6.5 to -9.5 6.5 to -3 6.5 to 0 3 h=21.9
zone mayortower
expect step 7

# The mayor's hyenas; up the ladder to his roof, where the white screecher rises from her nest
kill Hyena
expect step 8
climb 3 -2.6 h=21.9
zone roof
expect step 9
kill Caravan screecher
expect step 10
open Screecher's nest
expect story mayorkey 1
expect step 11
open Mayor's chest
wait 4
expect item Blueprint_EngineControls 1
expect item Blueprint_MetalDetector 1
expect done
